{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The cause and fix are documented in [ANSWER.md](/tmp/h-BVcjfS/ANSWER.md). Google could crawl the note page, but `robots.txt` blocked the API request that supplies its content. The app then rendered a “NOT FOUND” screen with HTTP 200, which Search Console classified as a Soft 404.\n\nI updated [robots.txt](/tmp/h-BVcjfS/site/robots.txt) to allow public note reads while keeping reactions, other API routes, and admin paths blocked. I checked the rule outcomes for those paths locally. No deployment or Search Console action was performed, so the live indexing result remains unverified."}}
